# React Native / Metro / Babel resolve modules from a flat node_modules tree.
# pnpm's default isolated linker hides transitive deps (e.g. babel-preset-expo,
# pulled in by `expo`) from the project root, which breaks `expo export` /
# `eas update` bundling. Expo's documented fix for pnpm is the hoisted linker.
# https://docs.expo.dev/guides/monorepos/
node-linker=hoisted
